sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App
  participant Planner
  participant Policy
  participant WebMCP
  participant Evidence
  participant Audit
  User->>App: intent + mandate
  App->>App: normalize + UUIDv5/v7
  App->>Planner: goal + feasible tool projection
  Planner-->>App: candidate plan
  App->>Policy: Canonical IR (pre)
  Policy-->>App: ALLOW / DENY / HUMAN / RECONCILE
  App->>WebMCP: execute only on ALLOW
  WebMCP-->>App: result claim
  App->>Evidence: read-back / receipt / state diff
  Evidence-->>Policy: Canonical IR (post)
  Policy-->>App: ALLOW commit / DENY / HUMAN / RECONCILE
  App->>Audit: signed AUTHORIZE/EXECUTE/VERIFY/COMMIT events
